{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1033_052kao", "source_sha256": "6f35d3b349c10ae73243d91e10c3d22e9d364abcc8647d8b4740952c9344d282", "ja": "{$P$}さんの、あの言葉……。\nただ上手に歌って欲しいってことじゃないと思うの。", "zh": "我想{$P$}先生的那句话……\n应该不是单纯希望你增进唱功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
