{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1035_052kao", "source_sha256": "4236ea14c236694df7b939ecd607e49f8fac4ff71d31ada253aee729c2d25d0f", "ja": "だって莉緒ちゃん、もう充分に歌は上手だもの。\nだから、もっと上達するとかじゃなくて……。", "zh": "因为莉绪你唱歌已经很好听了啊。\n所以他不是要你唱得更好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1036_052kao", "source_sha256": "99a13684123d8253e0b0549324387d036635516d40849e013ee5525ba0443331", "ja": "その、歌が上手……だから……。あっ！", "zh": "那个，因为你歌喉很棒……所以……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1037_039kon", "source_sha256": "aa271b0b52f12248afb5d935cc94536aef85bf9a41de139db41d8e92829b9b7c", "ja": "そっか！　それだわ歌織ちゃん！", "zh": "对喔！这就是他的目的啊，歌织！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1038_039kon", "source_sha256": "c660b84d9b5fae75a775fc240b92fed4ba2406397eb6d1707899ecbd1a1d4f83", "ja": "なるほどね。だから{$P$}は、\n莉緒ちゃんと気楽に話ができる私達を指名して……。", "zh": "原来如此。所以{$P$}\n才会指名能和莉绪轻松闲聊的我们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1039_046rio", "source_sha256": "2bb4e6caed47f8e14763d22a23593ea6a847f256f3a51142789f49995724aa6f", "ja": "え？　あ、あの、ふたりとも……\n何、どうしたの？", "zh": "咦？我、我说两位……\n你们是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1040_052kao", "source_sha256": "2d703564961993e6955dde7edf6f95b020df17d01045e984a5550c670b345c32", "ja": "安心してね、莉緒ちゃん。今日は私達、ちゃんと\n最後までお付き合いするから。ゆっくり話しましょう♪", "zh": "你放心，莉绪。我们会好好陪你到最后的。\n今天就一起聊个畅快吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1041_null", "source_sha256": "21f466959b384a6122bfb71493baa3fc3836b36ad31ffca7b7eda120ee873b3c", "ja": "後日……", "zh": "隔天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1042_p", "source_sha256": "568a76c7b08392a64ef815b8a3e0bf9812f39450bd47105221e0efe9249f5ff9", "ja": "まさか、昨日の今日で、朝から呼び出されるとは……。\n莉緒、話っていうのは？", "zh": "没想到我昨天才刚说完，今天就一大早被叫出来……\n莉绪，你说有事找我是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1043_046rio", "source_sha256": "b7b0e06cd9e6ac4a06c2f538aa3c43eff15813deb0c44143b6efab27018b5d2b", "ja": "あの……。あのね、{$P$}くん。\n昨日言われたこと、私、考えてみたの。", "zh": "那个……就是啊，{$P$}。\n昨天你说的那些话，我回去好好思考过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1044_046rio", "source_sha256": "59bfcac1496e739d8ac5e6150f7a1b046c743bbca0ec625d6207d40962dd51f5", "ja": "考えてみたっていうか、このみ姉さんと歌織ちゃんの\nお世話になったって感じだけど……。", "zh": "只是与其说我思考过，\n感觉更像是受到木实姊和小歌她们的启发……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1045_046rio", "source_sha256": "7432d35d0a948dd8a60661b9944153b36169949d19f7f59aa810e8a08093c063", "ja": "それでね……。\nあ、そうだなって、思ったことがあって。", "zh": "然后啊……\n有件事我觉得她们说得很对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1046_p", "source_sha256": "5e8fc77c785af0e35eae7d47fc974ac68bee661014483b1f1d7251cb78f90ff4", "ja": "うん……それで？", "zh": "嗯……是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1047_046rio", "source_sha256": "0cc4534634d2cbf27750b637967177d0165378832c1db914a769c58e4c3d9255", "ja": "私……ステージの上から、ファンのみんなの目……\nひとりひとりの目をちゃんと見て、歌いたいなって。", "zh": "我……想要在舞台上看着粉丝们的眼睛……\n好好看着每一位粉丝的眼睛来唱歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1048_046rio", "source_sha256": "d059a0ce18ac5690c05c2c54fc14ce9599118fd93a1e7aedcd19ed92e4223016", "ja": "気持ちを、きちんと歌に込めて……。みんなのことが\n大好きっていう思いとか、ちゃんと届けなくちゃね。", "zh": "我要把感情投入在歌曲中……\n将「我最喜欢大家了」的心意，好好传达出去才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1049_046rio", "source_sha256": "723e3dde2c54b972703a9285f81d6adee783cb8b2f671a218f99c24e758ae01b", "ja": "だって私は、みんなの……アイドルだから！", "zh": "因为我，是大家的……偶像嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1050_p", "source_sha256": "0bac416ed38d70c52c2d3cfd36ea295cc3703ae91948a65173af0f09ddf43da0", "ja": "莉緒……。", "zh": "莉绪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1051_046rio", "source_sha256": "7ad104359da8600ab5bda15e155ae373018371780c7be6a6f45d64bbc525a8e1", "ja": "まあ、話っていうのは、これだけなんだけど。\nあの……。", "zh": "哎呀，我想说的就只有这些啦。\n那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1052_046rio", "source_sha256": "7b02515099f045470094204a2c94da26140b873294a818ba7643a59b48a51b4d", "ja": "これで、いい？", "zh": "这样子对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_1053", "source_sha256": "a85a122147e5630b26e2f8f6e2614a5983fd33d87c8c5ae60f4d83b50e88ce23", "ja": "それでいい！", "zh": "这就对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_2000_p", "source_sha256": "96debf8987bae713c330d64418979ec196ccc8efe12a32ccdaa409807ffa8bbe", "ja": "もちろん、それでいいよ。\nさすが莉緒だな！", "zh": "当然，这就对了。\n真不愧是莉绪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_2001_046rio", "source_sha256": "68afdb3159230910374bd5deec9f34c0124aaae50c52be5e837327f319295449", "ja": "よかった～！　もう、全然違うって言われたら\nどうしようかと思ってたの！　はあ～。", "zh": "太好了～！真是的，要是你说我这个答案大错特错，\n我真不晓得该怎么办呢！呼～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_2002_046rio", "source_sha256": "977ac7576c870783bf8a1ae6f8ff1ef753e97aeff59fc5b539d723a62d86b374", "ja": "そうよね。私、セクシーにセクシーにって、\nそればっかり考えてたけど。", "zh": "也对啦，原本我满脑子就只想着\n要变得更加性感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_2003_046rio", "source_sha256": "94e0b6f9e1e848c38dec21df5a1b153549fdeeb315fd76d392ff8235fbd62e2f", "ja": "アイドルはまず最初に、ステージで歌って踊って。\nみんなに想いを届けなくちゃね！", "zh": "但既然身为偶像，首要之务就是在舞台上唱歌跳舞，\n把心意传达给大家才对嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_2004_p", "source_sha256": "d039ed931d9279ec3ba472d35f76dae9c34156c2319b19fa9b68f289f71a0f07", "ja": "ああ、セクシーなのが悪いわけじゃないよ。\nただファンを魅了する前に……。", "zh": "是啊，我不是说性感是坏事喔。\n只不过在迷倒粉丝之前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_2005_p", "source_sha256": "c48382b16b517146d045b982e4e48e4e22d5a4e1e88ca66c197f21a7fd85a3a4", "ja": "ファンにしっかり、莉緒の想いを届けてほしい。\nそう思ってたんだ。", "zh": "我希望莉绪你能确实把心意传达给粉丝们。\n这才是我的本意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_2006_046rio", "source_sha256": "fc358fae2fff422c405e83ed584abc8c1761e4268c8692f27dea7bfbe05fcc8d", "ja": "うん……そうよね。\n大事なコトなのに……ごめんね、忘れちゃってて。", "zh": "嗯……有道理。\n明明是很重要的事……抱歉，我居然忘了这点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_2007_046rio", "source_sha256": "7d6574e634f537f9df99f8f31a129fca2a696514b678308594982ad3c4f9e687", "ja": "でも、どうして最初から教えてくれなかったの？", "zh": "不过，你为什么不一开始就告诉我呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_2008_p", "source_sha256": "f8a7387c4d57feec9fdf5cb6dbd24b02e567e4fb634419a9cfe572e0338a897f", "ja": "教えるっていうのも違うというか……やっぱり自分の\n道は、自分で見つけてほしいんだ。だって……", "zh": "怎么说，直接跟你讲好像也不太对……\n我还是希望你的道路能由你自己发掘，毕竟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_2009_p", "source_sha256": "8abe511fad1cf17ed3315bf5544a835926a1276bda17af96c8792ac44b499628", "ja": "莉緒がどんなアイドルになりたいか。\n最後に決めるのは俺じゃなくて……莉緒だから。", "zh": "莉绪想成为什么样的偶像，\n最后决定的人不是我……而是莉绪你啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_2011_046rio", "source_sha256": "a3b69c699ec56d6f0cf66da9a4f464df69eb3f7ed6f839dc17bf8e73506b9075", "ja": "もう。キミって、本当に……ずるいんだから。", "zh": "真是的，你这个人……实在很贼耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_2012_p", "source_sha256": "2586e0dfdf7385ec5d0d58d77866ade0e8ddddb4200846c67ad47aca57500ad2", "ja": "それに、このみさんと歌織さんがいれば、\nまあ、なんとかなるかなと。", "zh": "再说既然有木实和歌织小姐在，\n我想总会有办法解决嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_2013_046rio", "source_sha256": "3154d6971a3431c12706434af9e5b299ac2c316097e51a0f49f1f1cd52621ebe", "ja": "あ……。あ～、そういうこと！　なるほど、それが\n{$P$}くんの本音ってわけねっ？", "zh": "啊……啊～是这样喔！原来如此，\n这就是{$P$}的真心话对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_2014_046rio", "source_sha256": "c28afc8e8b94bcb5942ea5e03f1f5e5f617e0900aa9b5e1399c16b2cca3b3875", "ja": "フーンだ。いいわよ。どうせ私は、\nひとりじゃなんにも気づけない女ですよ～だ。", "zh": "哼！没关系，反正我就是个迟钝的女人，\n自己一个人什么都察觉不到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_2015_p", "source_sha256": "f2badffa0c42737b2aeacde1aa351de85c37b0ad4f4784c3c97a46de04f15c32", "ja": "あ、いや、そうじゃなくて！　あのふたりがいれば、\nいろいろ話も広がると思って……！", "zh": "啊，不是，我没有这个意思！\n我只是觉得她们两个在的话，你们就可以无话不谈……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_2016_046rio", "source_sha256": "a27881d2933d612400a4fc1fdb5a05d32cf9a732a1aabb9e4347bae7e50bd0c6", "ja": "大丈夫、わかってるってば。\nそれに実際、あのふたりのおかげだったから。", "zh": "没关系，我了解啦。\n而且实际上也是多亏了她们两个啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_023_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_023_2017_046rio", "source_sha256": "3a94815986a1e7053cd542d099355584761c6934a6039baac9916c0f09d146b5", "ja": "ホント、感謝よね！　今度1杯……\nだけじゃなくて、10杯ぐらいおごらなくちゃっ。", "zh": "我真的很感谢她们！下次要请她们喝一杯……\n不行，得请她们喝个十杯才够！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
